      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A sleek spotted cheetah made from a sphere head, an oval body, four slim capsule legs, and a long cylinder tail. Black spots are embroidered on after assembly using a tapestry needle and black yarn. Tear-drop face markings are worked in black yarn directly on the head."
          }
